4,9255,9256,9257,9258,9259,9260,9261,9262,9263,9264,9265,9266,9267,9268,9269,9270,9271,9272,9273,9274,9275,9276,9277,9278,9279,9280,9281,9282,9283,9284,9285,9286,9287,9288,9289,9290,9291,9292,9293,9294,9295,9296,9297,9298,9299,9300,9301,9302,9303,9304,9305,9306,9307,9308,9309,9310,9311,9312,9313,9314,9315,9316,9317,9318,9319,9320,9321,9322,9323,9324,9325,9326,9327,9328,9329,9330,9331,9332,9333,9334,9335,9336,9337,9338,9339,9340,9341,9342,9343,9344,9345,9346,9347],"projection_sha256":"450a86bc04b54cc013637f90b21e0e0258d9f4f847d1875c30cb322a8b75abda"},"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun","book_id":"b-liangshu-033","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-033-wangyun-ws1514481"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","text":"子微字玄度，美風采，好學善屬文，位兼中書舍人。與河東裴子野、沛國劉顯同官友善。時魏中山王元略還北，梁武帝餞於武德殿，賦詩三十韻，限三刻成。微二刻便就，文甚美，帝再覽焉。又爲臨汝侯猷制放生文，亦見賞於世。後除尙書左丞。及昭明太子薨，帝立晉安王綱爲皇太子，將出詔，唯召尙書右僕射何敬容、宣惠將軍孔休源及微三人與議。微時年位尙輕，而任遇已重。後卒於北中郎豫章王長史、南蘭陵太守。文集二十卷。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":1,"end":2,"surface":"微","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0001","person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝微。"},{"start":3,"end":5,"surface":"玄度","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0003","person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝微。"},{"start":26,"end":29,"surface":"裴子野","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0026","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作裴子野。"},{"start":32,"end":34,"surface":"劉顯","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0032","person_id":"mcd_vna_05k","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉顯。"},{"start":44,"end":46,"surface":"元略","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0044","person_id":"ajj_c35_na9","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","inte